    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Zombie Dragon.</strong> This warrior of Vampire Counts enters the field with a complete D&D 5e profile: armor, hit points, weapons, racial traits, and tactical maneuvers are all resolved directly from the embedded items on this actor. Its battlefield presence is practical rather than ornamental: auras name their radius, diseases name their saving throws, and maneuvers state their action economy.</p><p>Use the inventory as the creature’s tactical menu. Weapons list finished attack or saving throw text; features describe the exact condition, movement, advantage, damage, recharge, or aura they create.</p><blockquote><p>“The grave is not an ending. It is a gate with my name upon it.”<br><em>— Mannfred von Carstein</em></p></blockquote><p><strong>Wargear and battlefield powers.</strong> This creature enters battle with Battlefield Doctrine, Grave Blade, Ancient Spear, Great Wight Blade, Claws, Bite, Necromantic Undead, Dark Vitality, Crypt Claws, Vampiric Sword, Deathless Will, Whirlwind Sweep, Leadership. Its drilled responses, charms, blades, and battlefield rites shape the rhythm of its turns.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
